cc6dd76c7a0db3" "q-107425/selection/cbbc96ecea05a5f2f4aa9b1956a3104e9204e81d87607124bedbf69d37971190"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107425" :question/id #uuid "a8f53ade-50ac-5107-884e-6acc18d8661f" :question/math-academy-id "q-107425" :question/problem "Write the complex number $z=-3-\\text{i}$ in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ giving $\\theta $ in radians to $3$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "To write $z$ in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $z$ lies in the third quadrant of the complex plane, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{-1}{-3})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{3})| \\\\  & ≈3.463.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=\\sqrt{10}$ and $\\theta =3.463$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.463\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-107425/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "01caf021-de3e-5e2a-89ce-ba289b65c0ff"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107425"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17521/selection/86d990c78e27896fb6aedd060c58030747e638f272ee530995923e6678afd3fc" :answer/id #uuid "8e9ad71e-c59f-51f0-a0e7-516d8e3e7c59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.678\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17521/selection/3d9a0b5d5edf166e6e86d99216c1ba3ecf7317035c98d4d423f381d7ad40939e" :answer/id #uuid "aadc8065-9262-5aba-86ce-9f6e6a2d693e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensur