math-academy-id "q-71981" :question/problem "Write the complex number $z=-\\sqrt{3}-\\text{i}$ in exponential form." :question/worked-solution "To write our complex number in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(-\\sqrt{3})}^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the third quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{-1}{-\\sqrt{3}})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}})| \\\\  & =\\pi +\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\pi }{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2$ and $\\theta =\\frac{7\\pi }{6}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{7\\pi \\text{i}/6}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71981/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "01caf021-de3e-5e2a-89ce-ba289b65c0ff"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71981"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection/012ccb5bfcb944046e72b19ebe0a4b745182789452b20a4d7a6f149f7d6a81f2" :answer/id #uuid "58b3d4e1-b419-5c68-9f70-67ede4505082" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection/bf7c84e10669db10520da372f3a4c2a1c7232e3ea1b2275727cc5ab497a02233" :answer/id #uuid "4536e8bf-0ea7-5a49-9a32-d4313fa305a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.249\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection/4f3f48fc9baa6648f228cf08d4ef8bf3575a679d39de3f909cb7f78f9ded6467" :answer/id #uuid "bc9fb541-9791-5b91-9543-760cddbc25d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.429\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection/66d5a1621a47edd6d60d08fea099ae26bf2c7bc5da9cbc297ebce327699d87d9" :answer/id #uuid "56be56fd-0b85-52e4-846f-acd7baa06cd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.249\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection/e1061311a219fcc18f430bd2f9ee06dcc79917cc6929fbb81be9f07750044b52" :answer/id #uuid "417b4481-a471-5263-97cd-2a97507b9bcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.249\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1501bd7a-f354-5e48-8fba-2ed39fca47df" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-17515/selection/66d5a1621a47edd6d60d08fea099ae26bf2c7bc5da9cbc297ebce327699d87d9" :answer-field/choices ["q-17515/selection/012ccb5bfcb944046e72b19ebe0a4b745182789452b20a4d7a6f149f7d6a81f2" "q-17515/selection/bf7c84e10669db10520da372f3a4c2a1c7232e3ea1b2275727cc5ab497a02233" "q-17515/selection/4f3f48fc9baa6648f228cf08d4ef8bf3575a679d39de3f909cb7f78f9ded6467" "q-17515/selection/66d5a1621a47edd6d60d08fea099ae26bf2c7bc5da9cbc297ebce327699d87d9" "q-17515/selection/e1061311a219fcc18f430bd2f9ee06dcc79917cc6929fbb81be9f07750044b52"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-17515" :question/id #uuid "d06b3ba1-cbb4-5f0c-b329-9ccba585ef58" :question/math-academy-id "q-17515" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953226/assets/ce8c8d74a7597f04300bf0094826c8245bbd98c45fe8521fec60bada68534f92.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ giving $\\theta $ in radians to $3$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =1+3\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the first quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3) \\\\  & ≈1.249.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=\\sqrt{10}$ and $\\theta =1.249$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.249\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-17515/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-17515"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection/7456cfce67981fb95dfdc00c309da25cf21637644c7813d2743c8c4d95d6378a" :answer/id #uuid "a53a9014-4a0f-5e2c-9e91-a0fea618c8d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection/87fca866df2f1d9afb237076127114c755538a100b467c802abf5438518a91e9" :answer/id #uuid "af6e13b1-5b52-5751-beef-3e5aecd92e9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=4\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection/2c549d96b500d3e51912114541ca09bdf5eef2082f4bb7093bc33df097f03812" :answer/id #uuid "db4886a7-3e24-53ab-af4b-13c10e5a3e0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=4\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection/1f883eb8eb09974c0a133d880f9147aec9a90cd6f58bb035bca5f03c9a340471" :answer/id #uuid "9e196a07-e8ac-5e3a-a250-6e0f630f4f17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection/3f44f0ac9c7292851b12ace5b0195d23d6f76b00e25a9c95f92eec975a48c13f" :answer/id #uuid "24957ce5-8bef-5313-a273-c3fd887c263b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a506ad3-c623-5a2a-8379-b31eb74e3745" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71972/selection/7456cfce67981fb95dfdc00c309da25cf21637644c7813d2743c8c4d95d6378a" :answer-field/choices ["q-71972/selection/7456cfce67981fb95dfdc00c309da25cf21637644c7813d2743c8c4d95d6378a" "q-71972/selection/87fca866df2f1d9afb237076127114c755538a100b467c802abf5438518a91e9" "q-71972/selection/2c549d96b500d3e51912114541ca09bdf5eef2082f4bb7093bc33df097f03812" "q-71972/selection/1f883eb8eb09974c0a133d880f9147aec9a90cd6f58bb035bca5f03c9a340471" "q-71972/selection/3f44f0ac9c7292851b12ace5b0195d23d6f76b00e25a9c95f92eec975a48c13f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71972" :question/id #uuid "4f04f4ac-0cb3-59fe-b7b9-4fd4996a151f" :question/math-academy-id "q-71972" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953226/assets/a0d3f6646cb3a1faa99ba07e76956faf9be1c6f117191c539aae63e3fc1a2ee1.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in exponential form." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =2+2\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the first quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=2\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71972/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71972"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection/649b0db722b83e0bf726791c1d22d54b0794f6b4dc21a1da71ee638522f54c4d" :answer/id #uuid "e0944585-b9b9-5a31-b54a-39887fcc57cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.605\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection/2d65b794fbaf560c260e91ca3daf7265db23d7bcd8ff53bbf33c932b3a9ca840" :answer/id #uuid "0a41bfef-21b2-5d19-8981-a7ed296506d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.678\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection/afe2dfe29f7abb166b683a4e953991327db03f0fa2418816a4be281fde6d1b41" :answer/id #uuid "ec4a3bd8-9019-5e67-9887-ecc6ccede109" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.678\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection/28dfc329ac962ac3a5574cf5ee9ffa59c2b7a732b1146044dcb453c10c95dd5d" :answer/id #uuid "ca13b29b-a033-5f4e-86c7-b8d0a5b90dc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{7\\pi \\,\\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection/4792753e40ae7210a8dd4126731843037ce34cc889dee0022c2223b540934714" :answer/id #uuid "84de1573-a25d-5301-8ac3-6ff3f8f34a3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.605\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5d356167-4418-5678-b3f0-a868c81f9ca1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8082/selection/649b0db722b83e0bf726791c1d22d54b0794f6b4dc21a1da71ee638522f54c4d" :answer-field/choices ["q-8082/selection/649b0db722b83e0bf726791c1d22d54b0794f6b4dc21a1da71ee638522f54c4d" "q-8082/selection/2d65b794fbaf560c260e91ca3daf7265db23d7bcd8ff53bbf33c932b3a9ca840" "q-8082/selection/afe2dfe29f7abb166b683a4e953991327db03f0fa2418816a4be281fde6d1b41" "q-8082/selection/28dfc329ac962ac3a5574cf5ee9ffa59c2b7a732b1146044dcb453c10c95dd5d" "q-8082/selection/4792753e40ae7210a8dd4126731843037ce34cc889dee0022c2223b540934714"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8082" :question/id #uuid "a7d92c47-1d38-5eb0-92d8-d988373605fa" :question/math-academy-id "q-8082" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953226/assets/18dd1668d0e9eaeb1be7919821707bbf1d472b22b00acf68a921a3522b2f5f7f.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ giving $\\theta $ in radians to three decimal places." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =-4-2\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-4)^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{20} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the third quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{-2}{-4})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})| \\\\  & ≈\\pi +0.463\\,64… \\\\  & ≈3.605.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2\\sqrt{5}$ and $\\theta =3.605$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=2\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.605\\,\\text{i}}\\,.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-8082/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8082"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection/e52f09c00d94bfee9a2a173173255bce0f563e0f43984574cbe65a618ce90563" :answer/id #uuid "b6f2ceb3-9580-528a-b384-a4d5f208ac0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{13}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.159\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection/c0688855248d5624c24ab689de3c218d153a4de971d308ce390051831c5bf484" :answer/id #uuid "5869d2b5-1000-5095-bcb1-0f15ad0a9a05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{13}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.983\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection/0ddb4cceda7c506da8bc48d4a875bba3944acbde5f1486b3040d1114e0849829" :answer/id #uuid "178963aa-5fc4-5b26-a28c-3f4b2abddcc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.859\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection/ae1fd518c105313b436f3577c92519531cb32e5d63058e908d742d160e1c7b92" :answer/id #uuid "c960c523-91b5-5431-ac21-c321428e148d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{11}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection/97a46f9d7088f8fe75492f8246534085eb5f541da26beb8bdfd0dc063330e4da" :answer/id #uuid "b5da35b5-3317-5823-bebf-1d2ec8790210" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.983\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d7a958f8-baab-5993-91b6-96ce675043fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8084/selection/e52f09c00d94bfee9a2a173173255bce0f563e0f43984574cbe65a618ce90563" :answer-field/choices ["q-8084/selection/e52f09c00d94bfee9a2a173173255bce0f563e0f43984574cbe65a618ce90563" "q-8084/selection/c0688855248d5624c24ab689de3c218d153a4de971d308ce390051831c5bf484" "q-8084/selection/0ddb4cceda7c506da8bc48d4a875bba3944acbde5f1486b3040d1114e0849829" "q-8084/selection/ae1fd518c105313b436f3577c92519531cb32e5d63058e908d742d160e1c7b92" "q-8084/selection/97a46f9d7088f8fe75492f8246534085eb5f541da26beb8bdfd0dc063330e4da"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8084" :question/id #uuid "786f2ec5-3904-5211-975b-9f7327fe00cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-8084" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953226/assets/a4066e842d7b94527aedd124c113ac9fd0b0f444d0d46152c5794c6f4d022074.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ giving $\\theta $ in radians to $3$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =-2+3\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2)^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $z$ lies in the second quadrant of the complex plane, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-\\frac{3}{2})| \\\\  & ≈2.159.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=\\sqrt{13}$ and $\\theta =2.159$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{13}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.159\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-8084/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8084"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection/e6096ec62ca9075fadd11b5455feca8d787928dc8ab60b17659c9ad6c9ea24d4" :answer/id #uuid "cd50944c-0faf-507a-99ec-2dbd52517f3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection/6a2da01742f4ac91c113be9b598ba15bd176e0a3ea760ca73885bdcfd4fe4110" :answer/id #uuid "2ed57aa9-89fa-5e52-abd7-cae9681035e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=3\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection/9c4f7ccf1a1819b0db112936f562f15b4116fcc4564e043539f6f9b253bee77a" :answer/id #uuid "ee82e9ad-534d-57e2-9e3e-61347468e97b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=3\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection/e36c5d19ac39b110a12e7a3f71ab1df560043efc3c3f32a92e0239d97cade0d9" :answer/id #uuid "e6578901-50b6-5f6c-9626-0461d3bf47a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection/3f44f0ac9c7292851b12ace5b0195d23d6f76b00e25a9c95f92eec975a48c13f" :answer/id #uuid "12c6b7a2-592f-5ec7-b33b-3d0055bd9ced" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e89bc8d-3db1-5bf4-9dad-36f962d99483" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107427/selection/e6096ec62ca9075fadd11b5455feca8d787928dc8ab60b17659c9ad6c9ea24d4" :answer-field/choices ["q-107427/selection/e6096ec62ca9075fadd11b5455feca8d787928dc8ab60b17659c9ad6c9ea24d4" "q-107427/selection/6a2da01742f4ac91c113be9b598ba15bd176e0a3ea760ca73885bdcfd4fe4110" "q-107427/selection/9c4f7ccf1a1819b0db112936f562f15b4116fcc4564e043539f6f9b253bee77a" "q-107427/selection/e36c5d19ac39b110a12e7a3f71ab1df560043efc3c3f32a92e0239d97cade0d9" "q-107427/selection/3f44f0ac9c7292851b12ace5b0195d23d6f76b00e25a9c95f92eec975a48c13f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107427" :question/id #uuid "fd5f7e02-06fb-58a5-8972-0a228aeaf734" :question/math-academy-id "q-107427" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953226/assets/7b72c7db59c20e5b3a86cde6b212cfdd88204588d0e5cca29524ba485aee5346.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in exponential form." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}+\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(\\sqrt{3})}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4} \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the first quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2$ and $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/6}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-107427/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107427"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
